Court Value scores and documentation (data/, docs/, *.md) are released under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0). See LICENSE-DATA.

From version 2.0 the Court Value formula and calculator are proprietary and are not
published or licensed. Earlier releases (1.0.x, 1.1.0) remain available from their
Zenodo archives under the licences they were released with.

Raw source statistics are not redistributed. Underlying statistics are derived from
Basketball-Reference (https://www.basketball-reference.com), via the Kaggle dataset
"NBA Stats (1947-present)" by Sumitro Datta, and from ABA game logs.
